  "details": "It would be nice if we could update a map, but choose when the update goes live. Would be very handy. maybe for avatars as well, but mainly for maps. So when you've got an update to a map ready, (such as say, a seasonal update) you can push it, set when it will go live, and it's mission accomplished, instead of having to manually update it at your chosen time.\nThink of it like how you can schedule tweets.",
